{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2022",
    "lib": ["ES2022", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "jsx": "react-jsx",
    "strict": true,
    "noUnusedLocals": true,
    "noUnusedParameters": true,
    "noFallthroughCasesInSwitch": true,
    "exactOptionalPropertyTypes": false,
    "noEmit": true,
    "allowJs": true,
    "checkJs": false,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "types": []
  },
  "//": [
    "只覆盖浏览器半：仓库主体是纯 JS 宿主插件，全量 tsc 会把 host 侧也纳入并需要 @deepseek-ai/* 类型包。",
    "src/locales-patch.js 用 allowJs 读 JSDoc 类型——卡片与宿主半共用同一份 9 语判定表，不允许出现第二份。",
    "tsdown.config.ts 归构建工具自己解析（它需要 node 的 process），故不纳入。"
  ],
  "include": ["src/client/**/*.ts", "src/client/**/*.tsx", "src/locales-patch.js"]
}
